{"id": "7th-t3-u2-q187", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u2-oppuravu", "lesson_id": "lesson-08-ilakkanam-pothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u2-glossary-match-2", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கலைச்சொற்களையும் அவற்றின் தமிழாக்கங்களையும் பொருத்துக:\na) Objective - 1. குறிக்கோள்\nb) Responsibility - 2. பொறுப்பு\nc) Poverty - 3. வறுமை\nd) Neighbour - 4. அயலவர்"}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 41 கலைச்சொல் அறிவோம்: Objective - குறிக்கோள் (1); Responsibility - பொறுப்பு (2); Poverty - வறுமை (3); Neighbour - அயலவர் (4). சரியான வரிசை: 1, 2, 3, 4 (C)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the vocabulary terms with their Tamil meanings:\na) Objective - 1. Kurikkol\nb) Responsibility - 2. Poruppu\nc) Poverty - 3. Varumai\nd) Neighbour - 4. Ayalavar"}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "Page 41 Glossary: Objective -> Kurikkol (1); Responsibility -> Poruppu (2); Poverty -> Varumai (3); Neighbour -> Ayalavar (4). Matches: a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [{"left_ta": "Objective", "left_en": "Objective", "right_ta": "குறிக்கோள்", "right_en": "Kurikkol"}, {"left_ta": "Responsibility", "left_en": "Responsibility", "right_ta": "பொறுப்பு", "right_en": "Poruppu"}, {"left_ta": "Poverty", "left_en": "Poverty", "right_ta": "வறுமை", "right_en": "Varumai"}, {"left_ta": "Neighbour", "left_en": "Neighbour", "right_ta": "அயலவர்", "right_en": "Ayalavar"}], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, 